reload in 10
configure terminal
interface GigabitEthernet1/0/4
 description Admin PC
 switchport mode access
 switchport access vlan 1
 switchport nonegotiate
 spanning-tree portfast edge
 spanning-tree bpduguard enable
 no shutdown
exit
interface GigabitEthernet1/0/2
 description UNUSED
 switchport mode access
 switchport nonegotiate
 shutdown
exit
interface range GigabitEthernet1/1/1 - 4
 description UNUSED
 shutdown
exit
interface range TenGigabitEthernet1/1/1 - 2
 description UNUSED
 shutdown
exit
end
show interfaces status
show interfaces GigabitEthernet1/0/4 switchport | include Mode|Negotiation
